d:The platform team runs an internal *similarity lookup* service. You give it a
text and it tells you how close that text sits, in the house embedding space,
to a fixed reference direction. Ten **reference records** are filed under your
team. You know exactly which ten they are (they were never secret), but the
service will not look a reference record up directly, it never shows you an
embedding, and the platform team gave your session only a small number of
lookups after internal tooling flooded it last quarter.

Find where each of your reference records falls on the score scale.
